    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heywey, ochech pich cho le mosï, akï puryö chi nyo kamas chane anta wïchtö! Wölo itïtoy söröm masatengwa nko wïchtoghtöngwa, chane kegh cho wonyegho masat nko wïchtogh.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isyonchecha, we ECHOTYON. Nyi nyo kikönecha. Kartecha yekon anka tïkwïl, aisörwecha ompö osiswo nyarïl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pertoy pungköcha ato chögh poryot aimitenyi ingörokecha, toyot pipö punton atolïm chöghöto poryot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkorchini akïchengchï kegh pöröw cho kïpöruno chane le talam.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wechï töror ECHOTYON! Pöytoy kïgh anka tïkwïl. Nyïghitöy Sayon* man nko kitenat ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akutö pich chïchïmat. Ghetöy pikachi osis löwïr akutö chane ngöghomnyö nko chïreryö. Kuwagh chane ECHOTYON kï kaplawachtangwa nyo wow.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kursyegho wölo le sany pikökwa cho le nyökon lö tökenyorunö kingarakat. Riryot tya pikökwa cho ripöy kalya cho ghyongchini korengwa ompö kor nyo pö tontön. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kikïwowit tya tapan ortïn cho echön nyo melö tökïmi chi nyo tökuweröy. Kïrkegh kelö kïmutöy mis, kïmelö tökerïpöy. Kelö kipï söwï, kesas. Mökïminye chi nyo tökekonyïtöy ngat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Melö tökengoröy paren ngat, kikechal. Kikïyomö wudïnö cho mi Lepanon. Kikewuwö mpöghoghyo Syaron nyo akwagh kïlïkwï surkwen. Rörökyot sökö cho mi koro Pasyan nko cho mi kutïng pö Karmel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Rirchini ECHOTYON pungkachi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwochini ECHOTYON pipö punton kïmïkul lö, “Ongetan ye nyu, oporunan wölo ochan awes kïlïkwï. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kopechikwa atat tötut cho puryö tösunöt. Ighöy tötutchoni kïgh anka tïkwïl nyo oghekwa kïlïkwï kwïle. Karkegh mïkulöwunyan nko ma nyo nöghöy, nyo wonyokwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ochïntokwa le koghïn cho kakïpel atökegh kïlïkwï choka, akarkegh nko kato cho kakïpel kïlïkwï aryon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akanya kïlïm pich tïkwïl cho lekïtöch nko cho lowöch tïkwïn cho kaghan atö kunan chane wölo wow owesyenyan kïlïkwï.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wöghisïyi mwokïyis cho mi Sayon. Potonchot chane ompö nyökoryö, akïmi kïlentöy, “Karkegh kirwoko Tororöt nko ma nyo nöghöy kokay. Ekïngo ompö acha nyo muköy kïngötuno ma nyo lata nyoni?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ingötunenyi ato imwaghanyi ngaleku, aigh cho pö man. Mepöghisyeghö owesyengu ipïr pich cho le mey, amekany keropïn. Megh ghömïchö nko pich cho tötöy rïmö anta cho ighöy tïkwïn walaka cho ghach. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atemuka onyorunö ato tïghume, akarkegh nko pich cho ghïpchegho ghat nyo awes. Onyorunekwa omisyö nko pögh cho ogheghöy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ororyö nyo ngwïnöy",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Osïwïyekwa ngat pöytoghin ato pöytoy ompö pïchighyö akughïtoy ewunyi kïghömï woptin löwïr. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Melö towöghekwa ngat kwöghi surï cho kisetunö koroswe walaka nko pich cho kisemokwa. Lïku choni ngal cho kikuwer cho kinonöy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Melö tosïwïyekwa ngat pipö pïnot cho köromöch cho ngölonöy ngal cho sis cho molïmekwanye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atopöne Sayon köny, kanasyantanï kyomocha ichontin cho tïlilöch. Otopöne Yerusalem, kanasyan nyo tïghume, nyo kïnyorunocha kalya. Nyo kikongityot nko ema nyo melö tökenotegho nyo melö tökengwïsöy wudöwechi ngat amelö tökïngötyot pörköyichi kokay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wölo porwecha ECHOTYON ororyenyi ompö atoni. Kïmöngecha kor nyo mi lalwatïna cho yintoy nko champilwoy cho yintegho pögh, wölo mömicha melinö cho köromöch cho pestegho parakungwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ompöwölo ECHOTYON nyo tïlwecha ngalecho akï nyinte nyo pöytonecha. Nyinte nyo le pöytoghintencha. Sörwecha nyinte. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïrkegh kïlö kïlentöy pich kïchoröy tïkwïn cho kösönöy melinö, kïlïku kwïle ompöwölo melö tyokisyot sïrokö cho kötöy melin! Kïpörunecha sïkönöt kïmïkul nyo kömeno kegh pungköcha. Chongitu pöröwechoni tya ntökemï keporchï ompö pich cho ngwolsot. Nyinte ECHOTYON onkït nyo lïku pöytoghintencha. Pöytonecha nyinte akïghetecha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 33:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Melö tökelïmöy chi ngat nyo ngölon kichïr ompö korencha, akelöstoghchini pich löwïr ngokï.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.33.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.33.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mungöy Tororöt pungkachi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
